<title>NETHERLANDS: CMG sees further growth in 1997.</title>
<headline>CMG sees further growth in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-Dutch computer services firm CMG Plc said on Monday it expected to achieve a &quot;healthy&quot; profit growth in 1997.</p>
<p>The company earlier posted 1996 net profit of 17.1 million pounds sterling, up from 1995's 12.5 million stg.</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
